{title: Kya Wo Karega Leke Chadhawa}
{artist: Bhala Vinay Katoch}
{key: A#}

{c: Verse 1}
[A#]Kya Wo Karega Leke Chadawa,        [A#]Kya Wo Karega Leke Chadawa,
[A#]Sab Kuch Tyag Ke [D#]Baitha Kahin,        [F]Bhakt Nahi Wo Bhala Hai Dhoondhta,
[D#]Gun Dekhe Gun [A#]gaan Nahi.        [A#]Main Kehta Nahi Shradha Hai Buri,
[A#]Par Karam Taraju [D#]Dharam Wahi,        [F]Bhakt Nahi Wo Bhala Hai Dhoondhta,
[D#]Gun Dekhe Gun [A#]gaan Nahi.        [A#]Mala Ferat Jug Bhaya,
[D#]Fira Na Mann Ka [A#]Fer,        [A#]Kar Ka Manka Daaride,
[D#]Man Ka Manka [A#]Fer.        Kabir Kehte Hain Ki,
Nahaye Dhoye Kya Hua,        Jab Mann Ka Mail Na Jaaye,
Meen Sada Jal Mein Rahain,        Dhoye Baas Na Jaye.
[D#]Tu Mandir Mandir [A#]Fir Aaya,        [D#]Tu Naam Mantra Sab [A#]Jap Aaya,
[F]Jivan Mein Ab Bhi Na Hai Sukun,        [D#]Bhole Ka Mann Mein [A#]Vaas Nahi.
[A#]Kyun Man Mandir Tera Khali Hai,        [A#]Kyun Man Mandir Tera Khali Hai,
[A#]Kyu [D#]Khali Khud Mai Jhaak Kabhi,        [F]Bhakt Nahi Wo Bhala Hai Dhoondhta,
[D#]Gun Dekhe Gun [A#]gaan Nahi.        [A#]Bhole Ka Ye Bas Naam Jape,
[A#]Are Ban Bhole Sa Kabhi Man Mere,        [A#]Bhed Nahi Karta Kisi Mein,
[A#]Iske Saare Apne Jag Mein.        [A#]Ye Bhola Hai Bhandari Hai,
[A#]Ise Puri Duniya Pyari Hai,        [F]Devo Ka Ye Danav Ka Bhi,
[D#]Iske Mann Bhed ka [A#]Bhav Nahi.        [A#]Shradha Nahi Dekhega Teri,
[A#]Shradha Nahi Dekhega Teri,        Jab [D#]Mann Hi Tera Saaf Nahi,
[F]Bhakt Nahi Wo Bhala Hai Dhoondhta,        [D#]Gun Dekhe Gun [A#]gaan Nahi.
[A#]Bhola Dhayan Mein Magn Lage,        [D#]Nahi Dekh Raha Ye Soch Nahi,
[F]Bhakt Nahi Wo Bhala Hai Dhoondhta,        [D#]Gun Dekhe Gun [A#]gaan Nahi.
[A#]Main Kehta Nahi Shradha Hai Buri,        [A#]Par Karam Taraju [D#]Dharam Wahi,
[F]Bhakt Nahi Wo Bhala Hai Dhoondhta,        [D#]Gun Dekhe Gun [A#]gaan Nahi.
